.* CMDWRKMGT: Work Management Commands, a group of the major command menu.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDWRKMGT'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDWRKMGT HELP=HLPCMDWRKMGT KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Work Management Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Related Command Menus
:MENUI HELP='CMDWRKMGT/OPT1' OPTION=1 ACTION='MENU CMDCLS'.Class Commands  CMDCLS
:MENUI HELP='CMDWRKMGT/OPT2' OPTION=2 ACTION='MENU CMDJOB'.Job Commands  CMDJOB
:MENUI HELP='CMDWRKMGT/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU CMDJOBD'.Job Description Commands  CMDJOBD
:MENUI HELP='CMDWRKMGT/OPT4' OPTION=4 ACTION='MENU CMDRTGE'.Routing Entry Commands  CMDRTGE
:MENUI HELP='CMDWRKMGT/OPT5' OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU CMDSBSD'.Subsystem Description Commands  CMDSBSD
:MENUI HELP='CMDWRKMGT/OPT6' OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU CMDSCDE'.Schedule Entry Commands  CMDSCDE
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDWRKMGT.Work Management Commands - Help
:P.Work Management Commands: the commands and the command menus of this
group, as the major command menu arranges them, with each name at the
right of its row. A blank row is a command this release does not
provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command or show the
menu, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous
menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command
groups.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows menu MAJOR.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDWRKMGT/OPT1'.Class Commands  CMDCLS
:P.Option 1. Shows menu CMDCLS&colon. Class Commands CMDCLS.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDWRKMGT/OPT2'.Job Commands  CMDJOB
:P.Option 2. Shows menu CMDJOB&colon. Job Commands CMDJOB.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDWRKMGT/OPT3'.Job Description Commands  CMDJOBD
:P.Option 3. Shows menu CMDJOBD&colon. Job Description Commands CMDJOBD.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDWRKMGT/OPT4'.Routing Entry Commands  CMDRTGE
:P.Option 4. Shows menu CMDRTGE&colon. Routing Entry Commands CMDRTGE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDWRKMGT/OPT5'.Subsystem Description Commands  CMDSBSD
:P.Option 5. Shows menu CMDSBSD&colon. Subsystem Description Commands
CMDSBSD.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDWRKMGT/OPT6'.Schedule Entry Commands  CMDSCDE
:P.Option 6. Shows menu CMDSCDE&colon. Schedule Entry Commands CMDSCDE.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
